{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/180557-soul-pacts","id":180557,"title":"Soul Pacts","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Demon: The Descent"],"posts":[{"date":"2014-06-26T02:46:56-07:00","id":180557,"title":"Soul Pacts","content":"Just wondering\u2026I know the core rulebook states that humans stuck with the Souless condition can't make soul pacts with Demons. But I was wondering, there are plenty of other creatures in the World of Darkness which possess altered souls, or lack souls entirely, and I began to wonder what would happen if Demons tried to forge soul pacts with such creatures...<br /> <br /> Let's say a Demon tries to sign a soul pact with a Promethean, or a True Fae (both of which are creatures who have no soul). Would the pact simply not take or would there be a kind of pact malfunction? <br /> <br /> What would happen if a Demon tried to sign a soul pact with a Sin-Eater (who shares their soul with a Geist), would there be some sort of severe supernatural backlash? <br /> <br /> Thoughts?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1868-hellovg","name":"hellovg","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"165"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-26T07:31:43-07:00","id":180796,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>hellovg</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/180557-soul-pacts#post180557\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Just wondering\u2026I know the core rulebook states that humans stuck with the Souless condition can't make soul pacts with Demons. But I was wondering, there are plenty of other creatures in the World of Darkness which possess altered souls, or lack souls entirely, and I began to wonder what would happen if Demons tried to forge soul pacts with such creatures...<br /> <br /> Let's say a Demon tries to sign a soul pact with a Promethean, or a True Fae (both of which are creatures who have no soul). Would the pact simply not take or would there be a kind of pact malfunction?</div> </div> </div> </div> Likely the same thing that would happen with a soulless human. <br /> <br /> Not sure what you'd actually be bargaining for, anyways. Prometheans and demons are already rejected by the world - and a demon needs a pact in order to hide within society. True Fae exist outside of the world; they likewise lack social connections that demons barter for.<br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> What would happen if a Demon tried to sign a soul pact with a Sin-Eater (who shares their soul with a Geist), would there be some sort of severe supernatural backlash?<br /> <br /> Thoughts? </div> </div> </div> You can take a vampire's body via soul pact, and it won't leave you with an undead body with the Beast in it. I fail to see why a Sin-Eater's, Forsaken's, Awakened, Lost, Mummy's, or other being's soul pact would be different. <br /> <br /> Now, there's no few abilities that demons have that can mimic other supernaturals. There's even a new Exploit to facilitate it. You can fake being a supernatural; indeed, you'll have to in order to avoid major Compromises from acting out of Cover. There's a bunch of social repercussions built into taking another supernatural's soul pact, and being exposed. So, in that way, there's a backlash of people wanting revenge for the loss of one of their members. But no mention of anything mystical.<br /> <br /> Now, your ST can do whatever they want for their story. But I don't see anything by default.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2102-mcn","name":"MCN","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2102_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3479"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-26T19:59:22-07:00","id":181562,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>MCN</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/180557-soul-pacts?p=180796#post180796\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"> Likely the same thing that would happen with a soulless human.<br /> <br /> Not sure what you'd actually be bargaining for, anyways. Prometheans and demons are already rejected by the world - and a demon needs a pact in order to hide within society. True Fae exist outside of the world; they likewise lack social connections that demons barter for.<br /> <br /> Well I was working from the assumption that the Demon isn't entirely informed as to what they're talking to. My main concern is whether the Demon would know whether the pact took effect or not immediately or if it would be a drawn out process.<br /> <br /> <br /> You can take a vampire's body via soul pact, and it won't leave you with an undead body with the Beast in it. I fail to see why a Sin-Eater's, Forsaken's, Awakened, Lost, Mummy's, or other being's soul pact would be different.</div> </div> </div> </div>Because the Sin-Eater shares their soul with another sentient entity. Which is distinctly different from the other creatures.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1868-hellovg","name":"hellovg","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"165"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-26T20:01:31-07:00","id":181564,"title":"","content":"I was also working from the assumption that in the story the Demon wouldn't be entirely informed as to the creature they were talking to (be it a Promethean or True Fae). Would the Demon be aware the pact didn't take effect immediately, or would they just gradually notice?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1868-hellovg","name":"hellovg","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"165"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-26T20:13:08-07:00","id":181571,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>hellovg</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/180557-soul-pacts?p=181562#post181562\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Because the Sin-Eater shares their soul with another sentient entity. Which is distinctly different from the other creatures.</div> </div> </div> </div>Except that that matters precisely fuckall, because what a soul pact <i>actually deals in</i> is the place in human society reserved, in the world, for the owner of the soul in question. Bound geister have no direct say in that place, just as a vampire's Beast or the memory of a changeling's Keeper doesn't directly affect the way the mortal community knows of them; it's part of why a soul pact from a supernatural being with a soul doesn't give you any of their actual metaphysical baggage.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms\"><span style=\"color:#4B0082\"><b>Resident Lore-Hound</b></span><br /> Currently Consuming: <i>Demon: the Descent 1e</i></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/111-satchel","name":"Satchel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar111_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9828"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-03T18:46:01-07:00","id":187566,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>hellovg</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/180557-soul-pacts#post180557\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Just wondering\u2026I know the core rulebook states that humans stuck with the Souless condition can't make soul pacts with Demons. But I was wondering, there are plenty of other creatures in the World of Darkness which possess altered souls, or lack souls entirely, and I began to wonder what would happen if Demons tried to forge soul pacts with such creatures...<br /> Thoughts?</div> </div> </div> </div>This is discussed in the rules on Pg. 194.<br /> <br /> Another question though, if I want to make a pact were a third-party gets a benefit (dad's cancer goes into remission, my son's criminal record is wiped clean, etc.) is there any way for the game system to handle it?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2233-agentwestmer","name":"Agentwestmer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2233_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"394"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-03T21:58:04-07:00","id":187717,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Agentwestmer</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/180557-soul-pacts?p=187566#post187566\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> This is discussed in the rules on Pg. 194.<br /> <br /> Another question though, if I want to make a pact were a third-party gets a benefit (dad's cancer goes into remission, my son's criminal record is wiped clean, etc.) is there any way for the game system to handle it?</div> </div> </div> </div>Well I did read (granted, it was the unfinished text) that Demons could perform hearings and even resurrections for certain pacts, but from what I understand granting benefits to third-party persons in the case of pacts is more labor intensive for the Demon in question than a regular pact is.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1868-hellovg","name":"hellovg","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"165"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-03T22:00:06-07:00","id":187720,"title":"","content":"I've been autocorrected! I'm sorry, I meant 'healings' and resurrections, for third-party persons in a pact...","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1868-hellovg","name":"hellovg","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"165"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-04T06:03:21-07:00","id":187879,"title":"","content":"Terminal Cancer and a criminal record are things a demon can take away from a human by virtue of them being facets of the life itself. The very thing that a demon might want for a patch-job cover. It might seem counter-intuitive at first to take a criminal record but when you think about it, trouble with the police is the kind of thing a clever demon could use to avoid angelic notice. Death and healing of damage is something that demons can simply fix with embeds and exploits and indeed there's no reason part of a contract can't be the agreement to use such powers on the behalf of the pact-bound it just wouldn't be covered by a point-value in contract balance and that might need some house-rules.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3036-desolatedolly","name":"DesolateDolly","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3036_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"179"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}